@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
User -> System : captureEvolutionPhoto()
activate System

note right of System: The system requests camera permission\nif needed, triggers device camera, persists\nphoto locally, and updates gallery.

alt Photo Captured & Saved
    System --> User : persists image with timestamp and displays updated photo in chronological gallery
else Permission Denied / Cancelled
    System --> User : displays permission warning message (Toast)
end

opt Delete Photo
    User -> System : deletePhoto(selectedPhoto)
    System --> User : removes photo file from storage and refreshes gallery
end

deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
